    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SHOPKEEPER: Nawi, tell your mother to see me for the dress!\nNAWI: What dress?\nSHOPKEEPER: Your wedding dress! I will make you beautiful. Tell her!\nDAYO: They have made you another match?",
      "NAWI: What’s your name?\nFUMBE: Fumbe.\nNAWI: Why do you cry?\nFUMBE: I am not a soldier.",
      "NAWI: Show me how to tie the rope.\nFUMBE: Never. It is the only thing I can do better than you.",
      "TARA: You are a Mahi prisoner, and that is all you will ever be.\nAMENZA: What did you say?\nTARA: She should be my slave, not a warrior.",
      "NAWI: Where are you going?\nODE: You are trouble, and I already have enough of that.\nIZOGIE: Eat up, Tse-tse. Nanisca favors the strong.\nIZOGIE: What is the first rule of training?"
    ]
